&lt;hr /&gt; 
&lt;p&gt;I love building interfaces and web applications that delight users. I grew up building websites for fun, and it’s my biggest passion.&lt;/p&gt; 
&lt;p&gt;I’m currently living in Hong Kong and loving the magic of reactive, data-driven user interfaces. I’ve been focused mainly on SvelteJs for the last couple of years, but I have 12+ years of industry experience developing web applications with Svelte, VueJs, jQuery, html, css, sass, etc. &lt;em&gt;(I am even a &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/sveltejs/svelte/pull/3627#ref-pullrequest-971933176&quot;&gt;contributor to the SvelteJs core&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/em&gt;. &lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/p&gt; 
&lt;h2&gt;Projects;&lt;/h2&gt; 
